.TH FONTED 1
.SH NAME
fonted \- bitmap font editor
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/fonted
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I FontEd
is a bitmap font editor.
It runs under
.IR wm (1).
.PP
Select a glyph from the chart and toggle pixels in the magnified grid. The s key writes a hex dump under /tmp.
.PP
The controls are:
.TF space
.TP
.B LMB on chart
Select glyph
.TP
.B LMB on big grid
Toggle pixel bit
.TP
.B , / <
Previous character
.TP
.B . / >
Next character
.TP
.B *
Fill / related edit action
.TP
.B s
Save hex to /tmp/temple-font.hex
.TP
.B Esc / q
Quit
.PD
.SH FILES
.TP
.B /tmp/temple-font.hex
Data file.
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/temple/fonted.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR temple (1),
.IR wm (1)
